{
  "id": "02-online-softmax",
  "title": "online softmax 的状态递推",
  "kind": "flow",
  "direction": "LR",
  "section": "2.2",
  "nodeMaxEm": 24,
  "caption": "每处理一块 key 只维护三个每行状态：运行最大值 m、分母 ℓ、未归一化分子 O。",
  "nodes": [
    { "id": "s0", "label": "初始", "sub": "m = −inf，ℓ = 0，O = 0", "tone": "muted" },
    { "id": "b1", "label": "块 1：S₁ = Q·K₁ᵀ·s", "tone": "compute" },
    {
      "id": "m1",
      "label": "m₁ = max(m₀, rowmax(S₁))",
      "sub": "c₁ = exp(m₀ − m₁)",
      "tone": "default"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1",
      "label": "ℓ = c₁·ℓ + rowsum(exp(S₁ − m₁))",
      "sub": "O = c₁·O + exp(S₁ − m₁)·V₁",
      "tone": "compute"
    },
    { "id": "b2", "label": "块 2：S₂ = Q·K₂ᵀ·s", "tone": "compute" },
    {
      "id": "m2",
      "label": "m₂ = max(m₁, rowmax(S₂))",
      "sub": "c₂ = exp(m₁ − m₂)",
      "tone": "default"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2",
      "label": "ℓ = c₂·ℓ + rowsum(exp(S₂ − m₂))",
      "sub": "O = c₂·O + exp(S₂ − m₂)·V₂",
      "tone": "compute"
    },
    { "id": "d", "label": "输出 O / ℓ", "tone": "accent" },
    {
      "id": "x",
      "label": "与完整 softmax 完全等价",
      "sub": "exp(−m) 在分子分母上约掉",
      "tone": "accent"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    { "from": "s0", "to": "b1" },
    { "from": "b1", "to": "m1" },
    { "from": "m1", "to": "a1" },
    { "from": "a1", "to": "b2" },
    { "from": "b2", "to": "m2" },
    { "from": "m2", "to": "a2" },
    { "from": "a2", "to": "d" },
    { "from": "d", "to": "x" }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "c = exp(m_prev − m_new) 永远落在 (0, 1]：新块更大就等比缩小旧累加器，没有更大就 c = 1",
    "边界：某行所有分数都被 mask 掉时 m_prev = m_new = −∞，c = exp2(NaN) = NaN 会污染 acc_o，需要 check_inf",
    "ℓ 和 O 并不单调——但两者被同一个 c 缩放，所以它们的比值始终不变"
  ]
}
